ed static checks and tests**\n\n**Assessing heritable field inheritance consistency**\n**Planning focused mutation function evaluation**\n**Designing mutation walk experiments**\n\n**Planning focused rule90 validation experiment**\n**Preparing Clojure reach test with rule90 parameters**\n\n**Identifying critical test coverage gaps**\n**Planning verification of post-edit measurements**\n\n**Identifying missing executable tests**\n\n**Planning static checks and validation**\n**Planning safe code evaluation strategy**\n**Investigating commit for genotype details**\n\n**Analyzing reproduction genotype seeding**\n\n**Planning initial Lean run**\n\n**Running clj-kondo analysis**\n\n\n\n**Planning RNG proxy instrumentation**\n**Designing deterministic RNG tests**\n**Planning mutation toggle coverage test**\n\n**Planning namespace isolation for function comparison**\n**Designing genotype-consistent phenotype comparisons**\n**Clarifying genotype injection across seeds**\n\n**Verifying seed-dependent reproducibility**\n**Inspecting phenotype boundary calibration**\n\n**Inspecting new baldwins_selection_lib.clj**\n\n**Checking library file history**\n\n**Running focused Clojure tests**\n**Implementing Java Random proxy for testing**\n\n**Planning protocol comparison approach**\n**Designing A/B testing for two-stage functions**\n**Planning isolated namespace loading for river**\n\n**Verifying namespace resolution**\n\n**Verifying isolated namespace setup**\n**Preparing source comparison run**\n\n**Finalizing endpoint production**\n\n**Planning nondegeneracy check across gamma**\n**Estimating runtime for gamma profiling**\n**Confirming profile setup with initial genome**\n\n**Identifying genome structure mismatch**\n**Evaluating plastic dependence modeling gaps**\n**Noting lack of joint plasticity data**\n\n**Clarifying score output and accessibility limitations**\n**Identifying calibration and threshold mismatches**\n**Noting fixed seeds causing overfitting**\n\n**Planning full